    "text": "- 2025-07-31 — Treasury’s Monthly Schedules of Federal Debt report shows the **average interest rate on Intragovernmental Debt Holdings without TIPS and FRNs was 3.1%**; the report also notes the **nonmarketable balance includes inflation indexed securities of $86,563 million** excluded from that average-rate calculation. Source: https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202507.pdf ([fiscaldata.treasury.gov](https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202507.pdf?utm_source=openai))\n- 2025-05-31 — Treasury’s Monthly Schedules of Federal Debt report shows the **average interest rate on Intragovernmental Debt Holdings without TIPS and FRNs was 2.9%**. Source: https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202505.pdf ([fiscaldata.treasury.gov](https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202505.pdf?utm_source=openai))\n- 2025-04-30 — Treasury’s Monthly Schedules of Federal Debt report shows the **average interest rate on Intragovernmental Debt Holdings without TIPS and FRNs was 3.0%**; it also notes **inflation indexed securities of $87,436 million** are excluded from the nonmarketable balance in that calculation. Source: https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202504.pdf ([fiscaldata.treasury.gov](https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202504.pdf?utm_source=openai))\n- 2025-02-28 — Treasury’s Monthly Schedules of Federal Debt report shows the **average interest rate on Intragovernmental Debt Holdings without TIPS and FRNs was 3.0%**. Source: https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202502.pdf ([fiscaldata.treasury.gov](https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202502.pdf?utm_source=openai))\n\nI did not find a 2026 Fiscal Data result matching the exact query terms on the Treasury site, so the most recent official matches I found were from 2025. ([fiscaldata.treasury.gov](https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202507.pdf?utm_source=openai))"
