    "text": "- 2025-07-31 — Treasury’s monthly **Schedules of Federal Debt** report shows **Federal Debt Held by the Public** at **$29,531,341 million**, with an **average interest rate of 3.8%** for **nonmarketable debt**; the table also lists average rates by security type, including Treasury bills (4.3%), notes (3.1%), bonds (3.3%), TIPS (0.9%), and floating rate notes (4.4%). Source: https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202507.pdf ([fiscaldata.treasury.gov](https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202507.pdf?utm_source=openai))\n\n- 2025-05-31 — Treasury’s monthly **Schedules of Federal Debt** report shows **Federal Debt Held by the Public** at **$28,911,509 million**, with an **average interest rate of 3.7%** for **nonmarketable debt**; the report also lists marketable security rates, including Treasury bills (4.3%), notes (3.0%), bonds (3.3%), TIPS (0.8%), and floating rate notes (4.4%). Source: https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202505.pdf ([fiscaldata.treasury.gov](https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202505.pdf?utm_source=openai))\n\n- 2025-01-31 — Treasury’s monthly **Schedules of Federal Debt** report shows **Federal Debt Held by the Public** at **$28,911,509 million**, with an **average interest rate of 3.7%** for **nonmarketable debt**; the report also lists marketable security rates, including Treasury bills (4.5%), notes (2.9%), bonds (3.2%), TIPS (0.8%), and floating rate notes (4.4%). Source: https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202501.pdf ([fiscaldata.treasury.gov](https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/static-data/published-reports/schedules-fed-debt-monthly/SchedulesFederalDebt_Monthly_202501.pdf?utm_source=openai))\n\n- 2026-09-13 — I did **not** find an official Fiscal Data page in the search results that explicitly reports a **FY 2026 average interest rate for total interest-bearing debt** as of today; the closest official source I found was Treasury’s monthly debt schedules and related debt datasets, which publish debt balances and average interest rates by security type. Source: https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/datasets/monthly-statement-public-debt/ ([fiscaldata.treasury.gov](https://fiscaldata.treasury.gov/datasets/monthly-statement-public-debt/?utm_source=openai))"
